00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:11.210
<b>It's gonna be ya, it's gonna be ya</b>

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:12.710
<b>It's gonna be alright</b>

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.580
Aw, that was a blast!

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.130
Mia really is amazing!

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.330
Right you are.

00:10:18.330 --> 00:10:19.960
What kind of person do you think she is?

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:22.040
Who knows? She's probably nice.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:23.580
I see...

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:25.130
Shall we head over there, then?

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.500
Huh? Where?

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.040
Yes?

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.000
Who're you?

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.920
We are fans of Mia.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:39.960
We have come to offer a few brief
words of encouragement.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:43.670
Mia, some cosplayer guy who says he's a fan is here.

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:44.880
Coming!

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:50.170
What is it you want?

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.670
I was moved by the excitement
during your performance

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.330
and wanted to share my sentiments with you.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:57.330
Uh...

00:10:57.880 --> 00:11:00.080
Your performance was so much fun!

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.500
Thanks...

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:05.000
I-I'm a singer too, just an amateur, though.

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:07.000
I perform at Club BB regularly!

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:08.210
Oh?

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:09.960
So you're a singer, too?

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:10.960
Yep!

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:11.960
What's your name?

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.000
Eiko!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:16.210
And my stage name is E I K O in Roman letters!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.540
<b>This is Eiko.</b>

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.540
<b>I perform at Shibuya Club BB!</b>

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.540
<b>Following</b>

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.540
<b>Followers</b>

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:21.630
Hold on for a sec.

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:25.040
Isn't this awesome?!
Mia even asked for my name!

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:29.750
Your charm can turn even a cloudy sky
into brilliant sunshine.

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.540
It's only natural she'd ask.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.130
Oh, you!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:36.500
Hey, any chance you're free this Friday?

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.210
I'll give you the chance to appear at
an event I'll be performing at.

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:41.000
What? You really mean it?!

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:44.040
Yep, I'll DM you the details later.

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:46.380
Th-thank you!

00:11:47.630 --> 00:11:49.670
Also, about your... manager?

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:53.250
His idea of trying to stand out by
cosplaying isn't half bad.

00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:56.080
Uh, well, it's not exactly like that...

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:57.920
Well, I'll be seeing you.

00:11:59.670 --> 00:12:03.420
<b>Shibuya Sengen</b>

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:03.670
Kongming! Owner!

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:05.880
I got a message from Mia!

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:08.250
She's gonna have me perform at Ladies' Ready Night.

00:12:08.380 --> 00:12:11.500
Oh, the event at Club WAAARP.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.170
That's a pretty big stage, you know.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.960
I've never had an offer like this before; I'm so happy!

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.250
It's like some luck's finally come my way!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.920
They for real with this schedule?

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:23.460
Mia Iriomote performs on the stage opposite yours.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:24.580
Huh?

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:26.500
I go on at the same time as Mia?

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:28.130
Oh my god!

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:29.920
What? What?!

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.330
Kongming...

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:33.540
They're using Eiko as a stalking horse.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:35.630
Yes, it would appear so.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:39.080
Mia must've wanted to give me this opportunity!

00:12:39.080 --> 00:12:42.080
Like, see if you can draw a crowd
at the same time I'm on!

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:43.380
Eiko...

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:46.330
Kongming, this is an opportunity for me, right?

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:49.580
You should consider it the chance of a lifetime.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.130
R-right!

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:55.420
Therefore, just issue the command and I, Kongming,

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:58.630
will make unremitting efforts on your behalf.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:01.380
All right...

00:13:01.750 --> 00:13:03.540
A command for Kongming the Tactician:

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:07.330
Get the place packed to capacity for
my performance at WAAARP!

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:08.920
Oh, who am I kidding?

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:17.500
The path of the leader must be in accordance with
the heavens, time, and man to achieve victory!

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:20.710
I have been waiting to hear you say that.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:23.920
It seems the time has come to put
my skills as a tactician to use.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:27.750
That command stuff was just a joke, more or less.

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:30.460
Ya Boy Kongming!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:29.080
<b><i>ya</i></b>

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:29.630
<b><i>ya Boy</i></b>

00:13:29.630 --> 00:13:29.830
<b><i>ya Boy KONG</i></b>

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:31.960
<b><i>ya Boy KONGMING!</i></b>

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.000
Eiko...

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.830
Practicing before the club opens...

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.080
You sure work hard.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.830
Thanks, Kongming.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.130
Sorry about that.

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:49.210
You're worried about whether you can
draw a crowd, aren't you?

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.130
Can you stop trying to read my mind?!

00:13:53.380 --> 00:13:56.130
Live music event Ladies' Ready Night...

00:13:56.540 --> 00:14:01.500
The event makes use of three floors,
and attendees can move between them freely.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:05.420
The ability to see so many artists at once is intriguing.

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.960
<b>Sayonara Twintails</b>

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.960
<b>Happy Flower</b>

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.960
<b>Negirikko</b>

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.960
<b>Orange Lemon</b>

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.380
<b>Happy Flower</b>

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.380
<b>Negirikko</b>

00:14:04.960 --> 00:14:06.380
<b>Orange Lemon</b>

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:09.750
However, there is the downside that
people flock to see the most popular artists.

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:07.960
<b>Orange Lemon</b>

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:13.250
No one's gonna show up when I sing.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:16.250
I thought this was my chance,
but now I've lost my confidence.

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:19.170
<i>Mia Iriomote...</i>

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:23.580
<i>She has many long-standing fans and
a certain degree of drawing power.</i>

00:14:24.080 --> 00:14:28.790
<i>One could envision Eiko's floor being deserted
and Mia's being packed.</i>

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:32.880
<i>I suspect that Mia hopes to use Eiko,
a relative unknown,</i>

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:36.420
<i>to ensure that her own floor is lively
during her performance.</i>

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:39.040
<i>Not a bad play on the surface...</i>

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.250
but it's a puerile, ill-conceived strategy.

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:43.960
<i>There's that smug look again...</i>

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.420
<b>I'll make sure to have</b>

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.420
<b>a great performance!</b>

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.420
<b>I'm counting on you,</b>

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.420
<b>so do your best!</b>

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:49.420
<b>Thank you!</b>

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:56.170
Mia, I got that newcomer to commit to appearing in
this weekend's event like you requested.

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:59.170
Huh? Newcomer? Who?

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.080
Already forgot, did ya?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.750
The one with 200 followers who came to
your dressing room with that weird cosplayer.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.500
Oh, that girl.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:08.540
Slipped my mind. Good job.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:12.250
These days, it's more about crafting an image and
getting your name out there than talent.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:14.540
The attendees will pack your floor.

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:16.380
You sure are devious.

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:19.880
What was that about talent?

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:23.170
You're also more talented.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:24.790
Damn right I am!

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:32.500
<i>Rather than always working out and posting on Pinsta,
do some vocal training! Please!</i>

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:36.250
<b>Following        Followers</b>

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:37.460
Kongming, how's Eiko doing?

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:39.880
It appears her determination is second to none.

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.830
She's practicing at this very moment.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:42.830
I see.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:46.960
Here, this is the detailed floor plan
of Club WAAARP you asked for.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:48.670
I deeply appreciate it.

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:51.630
I take it you have a connection at WAAARP?

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:52.630
Yeah.

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.130
Lean in...

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.540
Oh no...

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:12.540
There's hardly anyone in there.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.580
I did my best to get the word out on Pinsta...

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:18.630
And Kongming's gone off to God knows where...

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:20.790
I'm getting' nervous now, too.

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:21.790
Eiko!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:23.330
You're up.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.540
Coming!

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.080
<i>All right! Time to do this!</i>

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.540
I'm gonna sing my heart out!

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:33.290
Ladies' Ready Night Volume 13!

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:37.790
Next up on stage is Mia Iriomote!

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:43.630
All right! Let's get this place bumpin'!

00:16:43.960 --> 00:16:45.750
One, two!

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:48.210
One, two, three, four!

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.080
<i>That's Mia for ya...</i>

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:52.130
<i>She can really draw a crowd.</i>

00:16:52.500 --> 00:16:53.920
<i>How's Eiko's performance going?</i>

00:16:55.880 --> 00:16:58.830
<i>Sure enough, almost all the attendees
are on Mia's floor.</i>

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:02.000
<i>Will Kongming's strategy really work?</i>

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.750
Yes, right this way.

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:07.790
Everyone, come on over here and
I'll treat you to a free drink.

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:14.210
<b>I've got a way out</b>

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:10.710
<i>What are you thinking, Kongming?</i>

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:13.250
<i>You're using booze to draw people in?</i>

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:14.790
<i>THIS is your strategy?</i>

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.460
<i>Surely, at least some people will stay</i>

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:17.960
<i>once they hear Eiko sing, but still...</i>

00:17:17.960 --> 00:17:19.790
There's hardly anyone here.
<i>once they hear Eiko sing, but still...</i><b></b>

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.500
C'mon, let's head back to Mia's floor.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.960
<i>To be blunt, it's a stupid plan.</i>

00:17:23.420 --> 00:17:26.040
<b>Now what can you see with your eyes?</b>

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:27.880
<i>I was a damned fool to think he'd actually come up with</i>

00:17:26.040 --> 00:17:29.880
<b>Sono shisen no saki ni (True faith)
</b>Before that gaze (True faith)<b></b>

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:29.380
<i>a stratagem worthy of the real Kongming!</i>

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:32.540
<i>As if you can depend on people
who're lured in with liquor!</i>

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:37.420
<b>Donna unmei ga egakareteiru (True fate)
</b>What sort of fate is depicted? (True fate)<b></b>

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:36.420
<i>In the end, they're the type who swarm
to the spot everyone's gathered.</i>

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.880
Huh?! Weren't the stairs this way?

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:40.710
<b>Let me see it, wow</b>

00:17:38.880 --> 00:17:40.750
That's the restroom. Haha, nice one.

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:43.460
What's up, sisses and bros?!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:45.920
Show me some energy!

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.630
Make some noise!

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:49.920
Good!

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:53.710
When you hear this song,
it's gonna take this night to the next level!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:54.920
All you guys!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:58.290
You sure are lucky you're here in Shibuya for this!

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:04.170
Dammit! What happens if tonight makes
Eiko lose her confidence?!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:07.380
Kongming, you punk, I'm gonna wring your neck!

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:10.290
Wait, this's the toilets again.
Funny stuff, dude.

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:11.790
It's like the stairs vanished!

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:14.210
Anyway, that chick's singing is worth checking out!

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:15.500
What's going on here?
Let's go!<b></b>

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.580
<b>We feel the heatbeat</b>

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.080
<i>Wh-what the hell?!</i>

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:22.790
<b>Tokei nanka hazushichaba
</b>Why don't you take off that watch?<b></b>

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:20.630
<i>There's a ton of people all of a sudden!</i>

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.710
<b>I sing a song for you</b>

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:24.380
<i>Oh my god!</i>

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:25.750
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

00:18:24.710 --> 00:18:26.420
<b>Party at it's peak</b>

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:28.880
<i>They're all listening to my song!</i>

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:29.790
<b>Yumemi gokochi ni sasetageru
</b>I'll make you fell like you're in a dream<b></b>

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:32.880
<b>Moriagannakya tsumannai
</b>It's no fun if it doesn't get lively<b></b>

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:36.580
<b>Me no mae ni kimi ga iru no
</b>You are right in front of me<b></b>

00:18:36.580 --> 00:18:39.580
<b>Seiippai tada tsutaetai
</b>I just want to tell you as best I can<b></b>

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.500
This place is bumping!

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:40.830
Who's that singing?

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:44.040
<b>Kono subete o, show you my soul
</b>All of this, show you my soul<b></b>

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:43.000
This is Kongming's stratagem at work?

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.210
What kind of trick is it?

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.130
<b>Be crazy for me</b>

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:45.880
It seems to be a success.

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:47.420
<b>Make me shine on you</b>

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:46.880
Kongming?!

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:48.540
<b>You're gonna see me</b>

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:49.130
No one's trying to leave this floor!

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:50.790
<b>When you hear my music</b>

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:50.580
What did you do?!

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.750
It's not that they are not trying to leave.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.710
<b>I'll be there for you</b>

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.630
<b>No matter where you go</b>

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:54.880
Rather, they cannot leave.

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:55.880
<b>How do you see me from...</b>

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:55.630
Huh?

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:57.290
Allow me to explain.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:59.580
I generated a large amount of smoke
throughout the floor

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:03.710
and set the lights along the path of crowd flow
to flicker to dull people's judgment.

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:05.580
I had two men in identical clothes

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:09.750
move between the entrance, restroom, and
staff-only area at varied intervals to confuse people.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:12.420
Furthermore, I set up two special bar counters.

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:16.670
The trees, placed in an equilateral triangle,
are like battle flags.

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:19.250
But conversely, the even spacing makes
it harder to find one's way.

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:23.420
This floor is in the style of a boiler room,
with the stage at its center,

00:19:23.420 --> 00:19:25.290
which can be viewed from 360 degrees.

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:27.500
And what does all this result in?

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:30.330
Yes, the attendees never reach the exit,

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:33.460
instead circling around,
and ending up at the restrooms.

00:19:33.460 --> 00:19:34.460
Impossible!

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:36.380
Who could get lost on such a small floor?!

00:19:36.670 --> 00:19:38.000
Please look for yourself.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:40.130
See the perplexed looks on their faces?

00:19:40.130 --> 00:19:43.670
It's as if they are being guided to the
restroom without knowing it.

00:19:43.960 --> 00:19:45.540
Enough joking around.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:46.960
It must just be a coincidence!

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:51.330
A man well versed in the "Records of
the Three Kingdoms" like you should know...

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:53.710
the name of this stratagem.

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.670
It can't be!

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:57.460
The Stone Sentinel Maze?!

00:19:58.000 --> 00:20:02.750
Are you saying the deadly formation from which
one cannot return after setting foot in it

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:05.170
has been recreated on this very floor?!

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:08.380
Though the formation is ill suited to a cramped space,

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:11.790
it is quite simple if one utilizes modern materials.

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:16.710
I also accounted for the placement of the entrance/exit
and restrooms in my use of feng shui.

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:19.040
Kongming...

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.170
My god...

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:22.710
Do not misunderstand.

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:25.580
Indeed, it was I who trapped the attendees.

00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:29.500
However, the true reason they do not leave...

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.290
<b>I'll never let you go</b>

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:35.290
<b>If you leave me, I don't forgive you</b>

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.130
<b>I steal your heart</b>

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:42.500
...is the power of Eiko's music.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.830
<b>I'll take you higher</b>

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:43.880
<b>Are you crazy for me</b>

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.080
What in the world happened?!

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.210
My floor was deserted,

